{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["\"ביום ההוא לאמור ישימך אלהים כאפרים וכמנשה\" — לאמור is plene with vav, in six places Ephraim precedes Manasseh, corresponding to six righteous judges who will arise from him. Therefore משול תמשל בנו is plene with vav, but המלך תמלך עלינו is defective vav, for all the kings who arose from him were wicked." "<b>אפרים לפני</b> in gematria is רגלים בנשיאים."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:36.527601662Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}